SUMMARY:Friday Nights at OMCA with CHIKA DI
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Live Music by CHIKA DI\, Dance Lesson and Showcase with Hustle 
 By The Lake\, DJ set by BLOOM\, and Gallery Chats This Friday Night at OMC
 A\, Colombian-American singer-songwriter CHIKA DI brings her vibrant sound
  to the Garden Stage with a high-energy bilingual performance. Blending Af
 ro-Latin rhythms\, Cumbia pop\, electronic influences\, and heartfelt stor
 ytelling\, her joyful set celebrates culture and connection while inviting
  audiences to dance\, sing\, and celebrate together.\nhttps://museumca.org
 /event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-chika-di/\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https:
 //pushpin.city/bayarea/
